{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35437","headline":"送刘尊师祗诏阙庭三首 三 · 曹唐","name":"送刘尊师祗诏阙庭三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙老闲眠碧草堂，帝书徵入白云乡。\n龟台欲署长生籍，鸾殿还论不死方。\n红露想倾延命酒，素烟思爇降真香。\n五千言外无文字，更有何词赠武皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}